1
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:52,060
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:53,442
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:53,443 --> 00:00:55,900
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,900
=Episode 5=

5
00:01:13,351 --> 00:01:14,000
Sihan!

6
00:01:14,799 --> 00:01:15,599
Sihan! Are you okay?

7
00:01:15,599 --> 00:01:16,040
Sihan!

8
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:33,599
Why'd you

9
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:35,640
call me back?

10
00:01:37,780 --> 00:01:39,000
Your father says

11
00:01:39,519 --> 00:01:40,120
to stay away from drugs.

12
00:01:40,519 --> 00:01:41,359
I haven't.

13
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,840
Stay out of Suowen's business too.

14
00:01:44,159 --> 00:01:45,640
Once you get involved,
it's hard to get out.

15
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:46,400
Please.

16
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,640
You really think you're my mom?

17
00:01:57,733 --> 00:01:59,840
The mine is your father's lifelong work.

18
00:02:00,599 --> 00:02:01,599
You can't destroy it.

19
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:05,680
Okay.

20
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,199
Take it easy.

21
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:14,960
I'll do as you say.

22
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,515
Happy now?

23
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:21,964
Your father's still alive.

24
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,759
Enjoy it while it lasts.

25
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,479
Sooner or later, you'll be mine.

26
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:39,319
Hey,

27
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:40,337
piggy.

28
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,000
You're so clever.

29
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,919
You actually tried to talk my stepmom

30
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:46,444
into luring me away.

31
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,319
Come on.

32
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,586
She's my stepmom.

33
00:02:51,319 --> 00:02:52,439
Why would she help you

34
00:02:52,439 --> 00:02:53,560
take me down?

35
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:55,639
Zhou Yan...

36
00:02:55,639 --> 00:02:56,439
I was wrong.

37
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:57,479
I should've...

38
00:02:58,560 --> 00:02:59,879
I should've listened to you.

39
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:03,120
I just wanted to make money on my own.

40
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:04,800
I fell for his trap.

41
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,706
I want to go home.

42
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:08,960
I want to go home.

43
00:03:09,199 --> 00:03:09,639
Okay.

44
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,199
I'll take you home.

45
00:03:11,919 --> 00:03:12,599
Home?

46
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,240
Hey!

47
00:03:14,759 --> 00:03:15,360
Home?

48
00:03:15,919 --> 00:03:18,240
Then how would you get such good stuff?

49
00:03:18,919 --> 00:03:19,520
Come on.

50
00:03:20,759 --> 00:03:21,199
Hey.

51
00:03:22,933 --> 00:03:23,960
You mess with me,

52
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:26,497
and this is what happens.

53
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,000
Zhou Yan.

54
00:03:38,071 --> 00:03:38,820
Go ahead, get mad.

55
00:03:40,159 --> 00:03:41,280
The madder you get,

56
00:03:43,093 --> 00:03:44,426
the more excited I get.

57
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,080
Zhou Yan!

58
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,599
Hey.

59
00:03:50,039 --> 00:03:51,039
Don't you like this?

60
00:03:51,502 --> 00:03:51,880
Here.

61
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,000
Have some more.

62
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,080
Come on, have a little more.

63
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:54,800
Sihan!

64
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,660
Come on.

65
00:04:00,666 --> 00:04:02,000
You dare waste my stash?

66
00:04:03,919 --> 00:04:04,919
Don't you like it?

67
00:04:04,919 --> 00:04:06,719
Come here. Have all you want.

68
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:13,840
Sihan!

69
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:23,360
Nice part.

70
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:27,199
Zhou Yan!

71
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,160
Zhou Yan, I did love you,

72
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:33,084
but you can't afford the future I want.

73
00:04:34,319 --> 00:04:35,240
If we stay together,

74
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,800
you'll destroy yourself completely.

75
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,279
Yan...

76
00:04:59,759 --> 00:05:01,279
Maybe you should get another job.

77
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,835
Keep doing this,

78
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,480
and your body will give out first..

79
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,759
Oh. I'm fine.

80
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,399
Sparring pays well.

81
00:05:07,399 --> 00:05:08,116
Six more months,

82
00:05:08,117 --> 00:05:09,839
and I'll have enough
for the diamond ring you want.

83
00:05:10,959 --> 00:05:12,480
I'm not worth that ring.

84
00:05:14,515 --> 00:05:15,480
All I can do

85
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:17,244
is let you go.

86
00:05:18,079 --> 00:05:18,839
Don't...

87
00:05:19,022 --> 00:05:19,880
Don't let go.

88
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,879
Let's start over.

89
00:05:26,524 --> 00:05:28,115
I saw how hard you were working.

90
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:30,664
So I came to Langia

91
00:05:30,665 --> 00:05:31,879
with my best friend to make money.

92
00:05:31,980 --> 00:05:35,160
But we never thought we'd get tricked
into body packing.

93
00:05:36,008 --> 00:05:39,031
They forced me to use drugs.

94
00:05:39,639 --> 00:05:41,959
I can't face you anymore.

95
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:44,968
Staying with you
will only drag you down.

96
00:05:47,564 --> 00:05:48,600
Getting all lovey-dovey, huh?

97
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,480
I'll make sure you don't last long.

98
00:06:08,199 --> 00:06:09,279
Stop hitting him!

99
00:06:19,440 --> 00:06:20,257
Zhou Yan...

100
00:06:21,399 --> 00:06:22,160
Forget about me.

101
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:48,266
Sihan!

102
00:07:03,879 --> 00:07:04,560
Officer.

103
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:07,319
This guy from Huaguo

104
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:08,680
killed and robbed people here.

105
00:07:09,399 --> 00:07:10,279
They all saw it.

106
00:07:10,279 --> 00:07:11,399
They can prove it.

107
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,210
Speak up!

108
00:07:12,210 --> 00:07:13,560
Yes. We all saw it.

109
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,519
A criminal like him...

110
00:07:16,959 --> 00:07:19,399
Officer, you can't let him go.

111
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:20,906
Of course not.

112
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:21,560
Take him away.

113
00:07:27,822 --> 00:07:28,640
Natuo!

114
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:32,040
This ends with one of us dead!

115
00:07:34,439 --> 00:07:35,519
See you.

116
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,875
Yan was definitely set up.

117
00:08:02,279 --> 00:08:02,720
Dad.

118
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:04,388
(Mokun, Police Chief)
That Huaguo man, Zhou Yan,

119
00:08:04,389 --> 00:08:05,990
came to Langia
to find his girlfriend, Lin Sihan.

120
00:08:05,990 --> 00:08:07,240
There's no way he'd kill her.

121
00:08:07,484 --> 00:08:08,880
Please conduct the investigation again.

122
00:08:09,140 --> 00:08:10,097
Got it.

123
00:08:10,604 --> 00:08:13,635
But now there are witnesses
and physical evidence.

124
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:14,720
It's goinig to be tough.

125
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,786
Zhou Yan offended Natuo

126
00:08:17,787 --> 00:08:18,560
at the jade appraisal event.

127
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:20,079
Natuo must've deliberately set him up.

128
00:08:20,648 --> 00:08:21,240
Oh.

129
00:08:22,519 --> 00:08:23,439
So it's him.

130
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:25,253
All right.

131
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:26,080
I

132
00:08:26,519 --> 00:08:27,319
understand.

133
00:08:27,780 --> 00:08:28,666
Mona,

134
00:08:28,670 --> 00:08:29,960
come back to the station.

135
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:32,568
It's too dangerous out here alone.

136
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,519
Dashan, Suowen, and Natuo...

137
00:08:35,759 --> 00:08:36,599
I've mapped out

138
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,720
their criminal network.

139
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,066
Once we arrest them,

140
00:08:39,070 --> 00:08:39,858
we can definitely get to Mian,

141
00:08:39,859 --> 00:08:41,040
who's behind them.

142
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,519
This evidence

143
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:46,017
is nowhere near enough.

144
00:08:46,020 --> 00:08:46,840
Do you know

145
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:50,520
how many higher-ups are protecting them?

146
00:08:53,048 --> 00:08:54,680
Then I'll find more evidence.

147
00:08:56,759 --> 00:08:57,440
Mona.

148
00:09:00,133 --> 00:09:01,280
I know

149
00:09:01,700 --> 00:09:03,399
you want to avenge your mom.

150
00:09:03,900 --> 00:09:06,320
But Mian isn't someone you can take on.

151
00:09:07,100 --> 00:09:09,480
Leave this to me.

152
00:09:10,186 --> 00:09:10,760
Dad.

153
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,320
I've waited for years.

154
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,440
And what have you found?

155
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:18,480
Dashan, Suowen, and Natuo...

156
00:09:19,620 --> 00:09:21,320
The police won't even touch them.

157
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:23,799
Zhou Yan is the only one
who dares take on the Big Three.

158
00:09:24,279 --> 00:09:25,519
So I've made up my mind.

159
00:09:26,039 --> 00:09:27,600
I'll use Zhou Yan as my way in.

160
00:09:27,820 --> 00:09:29,120
I'll expose Mian myself

161
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:30,200
and get justice for Mom.

162
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,120
I only ask one thing.

163
00:09:34,060 --> 00:09:35,159
Keep Zhou Yan alive.

164
00:09:56,506 --> 00:09:57,920
(Zhou Yan, I did love you,)

165
00:09:58,320 --> 00:09:59,840
(but you can't afford)

166
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,031
(the future I want.)

167
00:10:01,671 --> 00:10:02,760
(If we stay together,)

168
00:10:03,084 --> 00:10:05,080
(you'll destroy yourself completely.)

169
00:10:07,208 --> 00:10:08,160
(All I can do)

170
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:09,680
(is let you go.)

171
00:10:11,919 --> 00:10:12,679
(Forget me.)

172
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:43,400
Wait.

173
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:44,639
Someone wants to see you.

174
00:10:46,204 --> 00:10:47,315
Hey, piggy.

175
00:10:47,879 --> 00:10:49,480
Long time no see.

176
00:10:50,826 --> 00:10:52,880
Look at you now. What a pathetic mess.

177
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,520
Weren't you so tough?

178
00:10:56,524 --> 00:10:57,720
Your girlfriend's dead.

179
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,440
I know you're heartbroken.

180
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,360
I'm heartbroken too.

181
00:11:02,444 --> 00:11:03,640
It took a lot of work

182
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:04,883
to get her body

183
00:11:04,884 --> 00:11:05,960
out of police custody.

184
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:08,000
Look.

185
00:11:08,222 --> 00:11:09,000
Know what this is?

186
00:11:09,608 --> 00:11:11,155
Her ashes!

187
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:12,080
- Want them?
- Give them to me!

188
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:12,759
Come on. Come get them.

189
00:11:12,759 --> 00:11:13,120
Give them to me!

190
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,791
Come on! Come get them!

191
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:17,840
Look.

192
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:27,240
Lin Sihan's everywhere now.

193
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:28,648
I'll kill you!

194
00:11:29,280 --> 00:11:30,720
Didn't you say
this ends with one of us dead?

195
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,293
Come on. Come at me.

196
00:11:33,039 --> 00:11:34,159
Too bad.

197
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:36,279
Wu Suowen won't give you the chance.

198
00:11:36,640 --> 00:11:37,927
He's waiting for your heart

199
00:11:37,928 --> 00:11:39,031
to save his life.

200
00:12:24,040 --> 00:12:24,707
(Last night,)

201
00:12:24,708 --> 00:12:28,380
(rioting and vandalism broke out
on Langia's Old Street.)

202
00:12:28,380 --> 00:12:30,668
(The gang behind it claimed)

203
00:12:30,669 --> 00:12:33,720
(it was acting on Mian's orders.)

204
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:35,621
(So far, no one in Langia)

205
00:12:35,622 --> 00:12:37,840
(has stepped forward to restore order.)

206
00:12:56,728 --> 00:12:57,240
Hey, kid.

207
00:12:58,862 --> 00:13:00,600
You owe our boss something.

208
00:13:06,115 --> 00:13:06,840
You're...

209
00:13:08,039 --> 00:13:08,799
one of Suowen's people?

210
00:13:09,875 --> 00:13:10,240
Go.

211
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:15,395
The new guy
didn't know what he was doing.

212
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:16,680
He slipped and fell on a blade.

213
00:13:17,182 --> 00:13:18,200
Think that story will work?

214
00:13:20,515 --> 00:13:22,160
You know who's really to blame.

215
00:13:22,391 --> 00:13:23,560
Don't go after the wrong guy down there.

216
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:33,240
Then go see him yourself.

217
00:13:33,964 --> 00:13:34,702
Don't kill me!

218
00:13:35,279 --> 00:13:36,440
- I was wrong!
- Hit him!

219
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,159
I was wrong!

220
00:13:38,159 --> 00:13:39,039
Let him go!

221
00:13:39,039 --> 00:13:39,879
Move!

222
00:13:39,879 --> 00:13:40,480
Back off!

223
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:41,879
Get out of the way!

224
00:13:42,140 --> 00:13:43,066
You again?

225
00:13:46,340 --> 00:13:49,500
(Solitary Confinement)

226
00:14:00,759 --> 00:14:01,607
(Last night,)

227
00:14:01,608 --> 00:14:05,000
(rioting broke out
on Langia's Old Street.)

228
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:07,519
(The gang responsible claimed)

229
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:10,399
(they were acting on orders
from Old Mian.)

230
00:14:10,399 --> 00:14:12,375
(So far, no one in Langia)

231
00:14:12,376 --> 00:14:14,600
(has stepped forward to restore orders.)

232
00:14:16,408 --> 00:14:17,404
(Mian.)

233
00:14:17,759 --> 00:14:18,879
(The King of Langia.)

234
00:14:19,280 --> 00:14:20,071
(My idol.)

235
00:14:20,759 --> 00:14:22,380
(But no one's ever seen
what he looks like.)

236
00:14:22,380 --> 00:14:24,600
(All anyone knows is he has a dahlia
on his chest.)

237
00:14:25,159 --> 00:14:25,600
(Too bad.)

238
00:14:25,928 --> 00:14:27,320
(He vanished three years ago.)

239
00:14:33,799 --> 00:14:34,960
(Your girlfriend's dead.)

240
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,417
(I'm heartbroken too.)

241
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:38,426
(Look. Know what this is?)

242
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:40,702
(Her ashes!)

243
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,200
(Do it right.)

244
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,146
(Handle my heart carefully.)

245
00:14:51,040 --> 00:14:52,320
(Don't you know? Here in Langia,)

246
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:52,919
(this...)

247
00:14:53,180 --> 00:14:53,715
(this...)

248
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:54,986
(and this...)

249
00:14:54,990 --> 00:14:56,920
(are all worth a lot of money.)

250
00:14:56,920 --> 00:14:57,519
(Take him upstairs.)

251
00:15:31,519 --> 00:15:32,440
Go.

252
00:15:33,084 --> 00:15:34,160
Let that kid

253
00:15:35,324 --> 00:15:36,400
out of solitary.

254
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:50,600
♪Dust rises along the border♪

255
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:51,920
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

256
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:53,200
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

257
00:15:53,200 --> 00:15:54,500
♪Friends yesterday, now in battle♪

258
00:15:54,500 --> 00:15:55,840
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

259
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:57,200
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

260
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:58,520
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

261
00:15:58,520 --> 00:15:59,880
♪My life is mine to bear♪

262
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:02,600
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

263
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:05,320
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

264
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:07,800
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

265
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:09,120
♪My fate is mine to command♪

266
00:16:09,500 --> 00:16:10,440
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

267
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:11,840
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

268
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:13,200
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

269
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:14,520
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

270
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:15,900
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

271
00:16:15,900 --> 00:16:17,100
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

272
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:18,400
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

273
00:16:18,550 --> 00:16:19,800
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

274
00:16:19,800 --> 00:16:21,160
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

275
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:22,560
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

276
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:23,840
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

277
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:25,200
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

278
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:27,040
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

279
00:16:30,850 --> 00:16:31,800
♪With blood and sweat♪

280
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:33,300
♪I forge my glory♪

281
00:16:33,500 --> 00:16:34,480
♪In this world of chaos♪

282
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:35,880
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

283
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:37,120
♪My legend♪

284
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:38,720
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

285
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:45,600
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

286
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:48,240
